==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - attributes:
      usemap: '#catmap'
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like loading, data-role, data-action etc
